
//make truth table for (p | !q) ->: (p & q)
//to run Logika on Windows: Ctrl-Shift-W 
//on Mac: Command-Shift-W 

               *
------------------------------
p q # (p | !q) ->: (p & q)
------------------------------
T T #    T F   T      T
T F #    T T   F      F
F T #    F F   T      F
F F #    T T   F      F
-------------------------------

Contingent
T: [T T] [F T]
F: [T F] [F F]